#. ~ MOD description
#: modinfo.json
msgid "Start the Cataclysm in your own flat on an upper floor of a downtown apartment tower.  You wake up next to your bed in a fitting set of clothes and a crowbar is waiting on the bedside furniture, so a locked door is never a dead end.  Your floor has been cleared of monsters; the streets outside have not.  Everything else in the flat is yours to loot."
